 jq,
 whiptail,
 cloud-guest-utils,
 e2fsprogs
Description: Vortex OS first-boot wizard (web and console)
 Regenerates SSH host keys, grows the root filesystem, issues a one-time
 setup code on the console, and applies the wizard payload (password, SSH
 key, AI provider keys, timezone, optional Tailscale) via a root-side
 systemd path unit — the web-facing daemon stays unprivileged. Enables
 openclaw.service and ufw, then disables itself.
